OL,3,AMan, 61, in court charged with murder
OL,4,Aof 'stabbed' woman who died after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 61-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with the murder of a woman who
OL,8,Fsuffered "stab wounds" and died
OL,9,Ffollowing a crash.
OL,11,FEleanor Barnfield, 47, died in hospital
OL,12,Fafter police were called to a crash on
OL,13,FCoity Road in Bridgend on Monday, where
OL,14,Fthey found she had "puncture wounds
OL,15,Funrelated to the collision". The BBC
OL,16,Funderstands they were sustained in a
OL,17,Fstabbing.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
