OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMan, 61, in court charged with murder
OL,4,Aof 'stabbed' woman who died after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FClifford Foster, of Ger-y-Nant, was
OL,7,Farrested on Tuesday at the Ger-y-Nant
OL,8,Fretirement housing complex, close to
OL,9,Fwhere the crash happened, where Eleanor
OL,10,Fworked.
OL,12,FSpeaking only to confirm his name, age
OL,13,Fand address, Foster appeared at Newport
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on Friday, wearing a
OL,15,Fgrey tracksuit and using a crutch to
OL,16,Fsupport himself.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
